   Low stock highlighting.

   Applied to every batch row of a component whose TOTAL remaining quantity has
   fallen below its Master MinStockAlert. Bootstrap's .table-danger is not used
   directly because it is tuned for light mode only; these values read correctly
   in both themes and keep enough contrast for the text on top.
